# No application secrets are required in v1.
# Browser calls to `/api/*` are same-origin and do not need this.
# Server HTTP (Orders client is browser-only) would use, in order:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL, VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL, VERCEL_URL, localhost.
# Dashboard and order details read `lib/domain` in-process (`lib/api/rsc`)
# and do not HTTP-fetch this app.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://production-analytics-dashboard.vercel.app
